Full-screen Lock Experience

Use a genuine foreground Lock Activity running within the supported Lock Task environment.

Do not use a normal screen overlay as a substitute for Lock Task Mode.

Do not build a deceptive fullscreen popup.

Do not claim that a screen is locked simply because it visually covers another application.

Bypass-resistance objective

