Do not provide normal Start, Stop, Exit, or Unlock buttons on the Lock Screen.

Use the supported operating-system kiosk restrictions.

However, do not claim that a third-party Android application can make a consumer device absolutely impossible to shut down, reboot, recover, or access in an emergency.

Never intentionally disable emergency access or essential device-safety controls.

